  m_text: "\u2014 EQUIPPED GEAR \u2014\n\n<color=#FF5555>[WEAPON]</color> \nLongsword
    \n1d8 Slashing Damage \u2022 Versatile \nA standard steel blade with a leather-wrapped
    grip. Reliable and sharp.\n\n<color=#55AAFF>[ARMOR]</color> \nShield \n+2 Armor
    Class \nA wooden round shield reinforced with iron bands.\n\n<color=#FF5555>[WEAPON]</color>
    \nShortbow \n1d6 Piercing Damage \u2022 Range 80/320 \nMade of flexible yew wood.\n\n<color=#55AAFF>[ARMOR]</color>
    \nLeather Armor \nArmor Class 11 + Dex Modifier \nSturdy leather tunic offering
    basic protection without hindering movement.\n\n\u2014 BACKPACK \u2014\n\n[ITEM]
    \nAdventurer\u2019s Kit \nIncludes a bedroll, mess kit, tinderbox, 10 torches,
    10 days of rations, and a waterskin.\n\n<color=#55FF55>[CONSUMABLE]</color> \nPotion
    of Healing (x2) \nA red liquid that glimmers when agitated. \nRestores 2d4+2
    HP.\n\n[ITEM] \nHempen Rope (50 ft.) \nVital for climbing, binding prisoners,
    or securing camp.\n\n[TOOL] \nThieves' Tools \nA small pouch containing picks,
    a mirror, and files.\n\n[ITEM] \nMap of the Realm \nA generic map of the local
    area, slightly water-damaged.\n\n<color=#FFAA00>[FOOD]</color> \nDried Rations
    (x5) \nJerky and hardtack. Not tasty, but keeps you alive."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
